{"id":"1f087819d10a14c0","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-qubit.md","title":"Qubit","display":"df-qubit — Qubit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-qubit","aliases":["28-df-qubit","Qubit"],"display":"df-qubit — Qubit","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.2; local distinction between vectors and phase classes","source_printed_pages":"204–206","source_pdf_pages":"230–232","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-qubit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-qubit</span><span>Qubit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qubit — Qubit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.2; local distinction between vectors and phase classes"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"204–206"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"230–232"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_1=\\mathbb C^2\">\\(\\mathcal H_1=\\mathbb C^2\\)</span>；内积采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\overline u^{\\mathsf T}v\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\overline u^{\\mathsf T}v\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|0\\rangle=(1,0)^{\\mathsf T}\">\\(|0\\rangle=(1,0)^{\\mathsf T}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|1\\rangle=(0,1)^{\\mathsf T}\">\\(|1\\rangle=(0,1)^{\\mathsf T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf U_1\">\\(\\mathbf U_1\\)</span> 是本节点构造的归一化态向量集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Qubit}\">\\(\\mathbf{Qubit}\\)</span> 是物理纯态的相位商集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf U_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha|0\\rangle+\\beta|1\\rangle:\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb C,\\ |\\alpha|^2+|\\beta|^2=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf U_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha|0\\rangle+\\beta|1\\rangle:\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb C,\\ |\\alpha|^2+|\\beta|^2=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\sim\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\psi=e^{i\\theta}\\phi\\quad(\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\psi\\sim\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\psi=e^{i\\theta}\\phi\\quad(\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\psi]_{\\sim}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1:\\phi\\sim\\psi\\},\\qquad\\mathbf{Qubit}\\coloneqq\\{[\\psi]_{\\sim}:\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\psi]_{\\sim}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1:\\phi\\sim\\psi\\},\\qquad\\mathbf{Qubit}\\coloneqq\\{[\\psi]_{\\sim}:\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>内积、张量积作用在归一化代表向量上；Qubit 元素是等价类，不能直接当作列向量。相位关系为等价关系，改变代表元不影响对应密度矩阵。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§10.2; local distinction between vectors and phase classes，印刷页 204–206；PDF 页 230–232。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H_1=\\mathbb C^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle=\\overline u^{\\mathsf T}v","display":false},{"tex":"|0\\rangle=(1,0)^{\\mathsf T}","display":false},{"tex":"|1\\rangle=(0,1)^{\\mathsf T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf U_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Qubit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf U_1\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha|0\\rangle+\\beta|1\\rangle:\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb C,\\ |\\alpha|^2+|\\beta|^2=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi\\sim\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\psi=e^{i\\theta}\\phi\\quad(\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1).","display":true},{"tex":"[\\psi]_{\\sim}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1:\\phi\\sim\\psi\\},\\qquad\\mathbf{Qubit}\\coloneqq\\{[\\psi]_{\\sim}:\\psi\\in\\mathbf U_1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1577,"backlinks":[{"id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathcal H_n=(\\mathbb C^2)^{\\otimes n}$，$\\mathcal H_0=\\mathbb C$，计算基 $|x\\rangle$ 以 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 编号，见 [[28-df-qubit]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"状态空间：[[28-df-qubit]]、[[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"61f5856a7806f879","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\psi,\\phi\\in\\mathbf U_1$ 为归一化代表向量，见 [[28-df-qubit]]；$0<|\\langle\\psi,\\phi\\rangle|<1$。"}],"outgoing":[]}